    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276696</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_000&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……今のって……
何なんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...What happened just now...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>瘴気……魔界のことわりで
できたガスです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's Miasma...a warning from
Daemonium manifested as
poisonous gas.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔界の住民たちが
生命活動を行ううえで
ある程度必要なものだそうです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To some degree, it is necessary
for creatures of Daemonium
to survive.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、人間には
すごく毒なんだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, but for us, that stuff
is pretty poisonous...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277240</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私の仲間たちはみんな、
あれにやられたのでしょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Many of my people have been
felled by such a thing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277240</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、間違いありません、
あの洞窟にプルートがいます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Be that as it may, Pluto lies
in that cave undoubtedly.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だとすると、
なんとかして入る方法が
あればいいんだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That may be, but we should probably
think of another way to get inside.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>瘴気をなくす方法、
ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You mean to get rid of
the Miasma, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277520</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……オリジンに
頼むというのはどうだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...How about we ask for
help from Origin?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277684</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オリジンって……
精霊の王様だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By Origin you mean...
the King of the Spirits?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277684</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>昔話によく出てくんぜ？
今のアセリアの基礎を
作ったヤツだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't that from an old legend?
The guy responsible for creating
the foundations of modern Aselia?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277876</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの瘴気を浄化するには、
万物を司るくらいの力でないと
難しいかもしれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'd be quite a feat to purify the Miasma. I
believe we'd need nothing less than the power
responsible for the creation of all things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オリジンだったら、
世界中の瘴気も
浄化できるんじゃないかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you think Origin could
help us cleanse the Miasma
from the world, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>かもしれないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It could work, yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でもさ、オリジン、
また出てきてくれるかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah that's nice and all, but how are
we even supposed to meet him?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オリジンが姿を見せたのは
ラグナロクの時とダオス戦役の
時だけだと言いますから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Origin has been said to only manifest
physically during Ragnarok and the
war against Dhaos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダメかどうかは、
やってみないと
わかんねーだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, we won't know if it's
possible or not until we try!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278468</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_220_040_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう、だね。
行ってみましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, that's right.
Let's give it a try!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
